        "original_id": "baac38db-64c5-59b5-b421-7041ff2613a0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ferdinand Jodl, Alfred Jodl\n- Roles: Chief of the Operations Staff of the OKW, German general, war criminal\n- Organizations: Armed Forces High Command, Oberkommando der Wehrmacht\n- Events: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- Alfred Josef Ferdinand Jodl was born on 10 May 1890 and died on 16 October 1946.\n- Alfred Jodl was a German general and a war criminal during World War II.\n- Alfred Jodl served as Chief of the Operations Staff of the Armed Forces High Command, also known as the Oberkommando der Wehrmacht (OKW).\n- Ferdinand Jodl was the brother of Alfred Jodl.",
